Package: multised.engine
Type: Package
Title: Build and Analyse the MULTISED Marine Sediment Database
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Takaya", "Saito", email = "takaya.saito@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Institute of Marine Research", role = "fnd")
  )
Description: Assembles a database of marine-sediment trace-element measurements
    from five external sources (Mareano, Vannmiljoe, ICES-DOME, MUDAB and
    4Demon), harmonises them into a common schema, and progressively
    quality-controls the result through five database generations: pilot, slim,
    clean, merged and refined. Also provides the analyses run on the finished
    databases, covering grain size, iron and aluminium normalisation, organic
    carbon, spatial and temporal coverage, outlier flagging, and pristine
    background classification.
